DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260102
SUMMARY:☩ Plenary: Veni Creator (1 Jan)
DESCRIPTION:Veni Creator sung or recited publicly on 1 January.\nRef: Grant
  26 §1 1°\nUsual conditions: sacramental confession (within ~20 days)\, 
 Holy Communion\, prayer for the Pope's intentions\, and detachment from al
 l sin\, even venial. One plenary per day.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CATEGORIES:Orante/Indulgences
END:VEVENT
